            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><div style=\"text-align: right;\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/exasol/ai-lab/refs/heads/main/assets/Exasol_Logo_2025_Dark.svg\" style=\"width:200px; margin: 10px;\" />\n</div>\n\n<h1 id=\"abalone\">Abalone</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Here we will load data of physical measurements of abalones (sea snails). <a href=\"https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/1/abalone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow this link</a> to get details about this dataset.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">To execute queries and upload data to Exasol database we will be using the <a href=\"https://github.com/exasol/pyexasol\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><code>pyexasol</code></a> module.</span>\n<h2 id=\"prerequisites\">Prerequisites</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Prior to using this notebook the following steps need to be completed:</span>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"/?file=exasol-examples/main_config.py\">Configure the AI Lab</a>.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"setup\">Setup</h2>\n<h3 id=\"open-secure-configuration-storage\">Open Secure Configuration Storage</h3></span>"
