            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"download-data\">Download data</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">First, we will load the data into Pandas DataFrame. Each data column represents one of the features and is named accordingly, see section Variable Table in the dataset description. We will name the Pandas columns as per the variable description.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
