            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"upload-data-into-db\">Upload data into DB</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Let's split data randomly into train and test sets. We will then create two tables - ABALONE_TRAIN and ABALONE_TEST - and load the datasets into these tables.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
